          answer: 'SSH 22 · HTTPS 443 · DNS 53 · DHCP server 67 · TFTP 69 · syslog 514', hint: 'Remote shell, secure web, names, leases, trivial files, logs.', ok: 'Syn: "All six. The pigeonholes are right."',
